    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies .cs in Sprk.Bff.Api (RecordCreationService create and Repair); changes the owner decision on secure families (tags security, bff-api); NFR-01 lists FR-41 as security-sensitive.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Security-sensitive owner decision on Secure families (task-create 3.5.5b: tags include security), with a parity theory that may expose further create/reconciler differences to fix or file. The design (§15) is complete, so effort is high. Design §15.10 proposed sonnet/xhigh; raised for the security trigger.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
