  <prompt>Implement design.md §15.3: split `StampBeforeCreateAsync` into a plan half run at a new step 6½ (before the owner) and a bind/I-16 half kept at step 10, and make step 7 ask the owner over the item's lookups plus the derived stamp column → its root through the same `OwnerQuestionOf` / `ForRow`. Apply the same order in Repair. Invert 042a's three tests and add the §15.6 must-fire tests. Meet every UAC-r2 condition in §15.11.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer, .NET 10 BFF, Dataverse record ownership and Secure Record isolation. Security fails closed. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
  <goal>For every stamped table, a create (route, chat, decision, system) and a Repair get the owner the secure-child reconciler gives the written row; the #2483 window is closed; single-condition refusals, AppendTo probes, email.draft and Office codes are unchanged.</goal>

