  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project CLAUDE.md §6 gotcha 2026-10-20">Brief line 1: `git switch -c task/fm-042b &lt;tip of work/field-mapping-server-write-path-r1&gt;` (385e060e67 when written; use the current tip, which must contain 042a), then confirm this POML exists on the branch.</constraint>
    <constraint source="design §15.3, §15.7">Scope: the two RecordCreationService files and the tests listed. No new type, enum member, interface, registration, endpoint or package; the derived dictionary passes through DecideAsync's locals.</constraint>
    <constraint source="UAC-r2 condition (b)">Refusal words unchanged: 409 SecureParentNotIsolated keeps "re-run Make Secure on it, then retry". No "SecuringRoot" (or any mid-Make-Secure) exemption. A friendlier transient message is a client mapping and is out of scope.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-008 path A">Step 5's AppendTo set is unchanged: the derived root is never asked as the caller. The derivation stays app-only (PlanMissingStampAsync) and its answers are never exposed before step 5's AppendTo on the intermediate. CallerWriteAuthorization and the route filters are unchanged. Cite path A in the PR.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-07">Every single-condition refusal keeps its code, status and words on the route, chat, email.draft and Office. Only compound-failure ORDER changes (§15.4 rows 1-4).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">KEEP paths only (tests/integration/data-mutation/**, tests/integration/seam/**); no new file under tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/**; no Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;. 042a's tests are inverted, never deleted.</constraint>
